      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.0,
      "end_seconds": 270.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "your tummy is soft and your weight is stable on the scales"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.54,
      "end_seconds": 302.18,
      "duration_seconds": 26.64,
      "text": "Alright, you can sit up now. Having listened and examined, my working impression is coeliac disease on a gluten-free diet with some accidental exposure. Iron deficiency is also on my list. I'm going to order coeliac antibodies, for coeliac follow-up. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. I'm going to order a blood count, for coeliac follow-up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.71,
      "end_seconds": 305.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "That makes sense."
    },
